## Generator Implementation Details

### Format Specifications Implemented
- **Email:** RFC 5322 compliant (local-part@domain.tld)
- **SMS:** Spanish format (+34 followed by [6-7] and 8 digits)
- **WhatsApp:** E.164 format (+ followed by 7-15 digits)
- **Messages:** 1-500 character strings with alphanumeric + punctuation
- **Subjects:** 1-200 character strings (optional for non-EMAIL types)
- **Error Responses:** HTTP status codes {400, 404, 500, 503} with required fields

### Constraint Validation
- All 18 generators validated: 5 samples per generator = 90 total samples
- 100% pass rate on constraint validation
- Valid generators never produce invalid data
- Invalid generators consistently produce invalid patterns as intended
- Length constraints verified for all message and subject types
- Format patterns verified using regex validation

### Edge Cases Covered
- Empty strings and whitespace-only messages
- Malformed error responses (missing required fields)
- Invalid formats for each communication channel
- Boundary values for all length constraints

